n ticket or if you don't know when you would return, create a fake return ticket with Canva. Just take a real PDF ticket, open it with Canva, edit the date, flight number, etc. and export it to PDF again.\n\n## Money\n\n- Cash – spread in 2-3 places around your luggage\n- Cards – spread in 2-3 places around your luggage\n- [Body wallet](https://www.amazon.com/Money-Travel-Blocking-Sleeves-Daily/dp/B01C2R3TZG/) which you can hide below your clothes\n\n<!-- FANFARES_PREMIUM_CONTENT -->\n\n⚡ Zap 21 sats to unlock the full article on\nhttps://fanfares.io/naddr/naddr1qvzqqqr4gupzqgmemt809e9r4d4w89d9fdx7yxy0pe5d3la5xcee6dw88x3eud3sqyvhwumn8ghj7enpdenxzun9wvhxummnw3erztnrdaksqfrzvgurvde3xuuz6dpcvyej6drpxymj6wpexdnz6df3vs6nxc3cxccr2vekwlq4xd","created_at":1785129312,"id":"1ac1e69fcc8a20ddba23f59a759f25fc5ef4ba797dda2a64ffe39dcfc67ed44b","kind":30023,"pubkey":"2379dacef2e4a3ab6ae395a54b4de2188f0e68d8ffb436339d35c739a39e3630","sig":"1676e9d5a1182decc9e71401da1f7f87409dca9aaaba3b4f16ecd16f6c6c6ab7c78ca87c120000cf5ce612670cd834579e8ce88ce989b0e908b4778a63cf44b3","tags":[["d","bb867178-48a3-4a17-893f-51d53b860536"],["encrypted","aes-256-gcm",""],["price","21","SATS"],["referral","1"],["a","31990:d7d8109ee43657ce6056ada4653006bbb641f31e50e85243681c2724507811ec:Fanfares","wss://fanfares.nostr1.com"],["client","Fanfares","31990:d7d8109ee43657ce6056ada4653006bbb641f31e50e85243681c2724507811ec:Fanfares","wss://fanfares.nostr1.com"],["X","3081b39829b68bd2e77a2fd841b92302ae49bdcfa475e7293dd99bb7e6ed9c9b","minhash-equality-v1"],["published_at","1785129312"],["title","Test: LATAM Travel List"],["summary","Test"],["zap","2379dacef2e4a3ab6ae395a54b4de2188f0e68d8ffb436339d35c739a39e3630","wss://fanfares.nostr1.com","21"]]}}